    <string name="onboarding_all_files_title">Let X-Security remove threats</string>
    <string name="onboarding_all_files_body">X-Security is an antivirus: when a file is confirmed malicious it copies it into an encrypted quarantine vault and then removes the original — but only after you tap Delete now. With All Files Access that tap removes the file directly. Without it, Android shows its own delete confirmation each time; everything still works, with one extra tap. Nothing is ever deleted without your tap.</string>
